      "GmdIndex" : 0,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Thanks to Ser Arisen, we've reclaimed the\r\ncastle, and as you can see, the General Shop\r\nhas reopened for business.",
        "Jp" : "覚者様のおかげで城も取り戻せたし\r\nこの通り、よろず屋も\r\n再開できるまでになりました"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 633778,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "People are gradually returning to their daily\r\nlives, but... Remnants of the forces\r\nthat occupied this castle still remain!",
        "Jp" : "みんな日々の暮らしを取り戻しつつあるんですが――\r\n実は、この城を占領していた残党が\r\nまだいるようなんです！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 633779,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 2,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "They're holed up in the defensive area\r\noutside the walls—\r\nWe can't say we've fully\r\nretaken the castle while they're still there.",
        "Jp" : "なんでも、城外の防衛区画に籠城してるとか――\r\nここもいつまた攻め込まれるか分からない状況で\r\n\"完全奪還\"とは言い難いかもしれません"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 633780,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 3,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "If Chief Strategist Sonel were here, he'd\r\nhave a plan ready in no time and retake the\r\narea outside the walls in a flash...",
        "Jp" : "こんな時、参謀官のソネル様がいれば\r\n真っ先に作戦を立てて、電光石火で\r\n城外も奪還してる頃なんでしょうけど――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 633787,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 4,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I heard that when the Demon Army took\r\nLookout Castle, he was imprisoned in\r\nthe dungeon—",
        "Jp" : "聞いた話によると\r\n展望城が魔軍に奪われた時に\r\n地下牢に幽閉されたとか――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 633788,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Don't you think it's about time he showed up?\r\nI wonder if something happened to him.",
        "Jp" : "それならもう出てきてもいい頃だと思いませんか？\r\nもしかして、何かあったんでしょうか"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 709432,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
