      "GmdIndex" : 6,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Ah, Ser Sonel is the Liberation Army's chief\r\nstrategist. He comes up with unconventional\r\nplans—they call him a \r\n'genius who goes above and beyond.'",
        "Jp" : "ああ、ソネル様は解放軍の参謀官なんですよ\r\n奇抜な作戦を立てる方で――\r\n\"一周まわり過ぎた天才\"と言われるほどです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 633781,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 7,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "He's indispensable for retaking the area\r\noutside the walls...\r\nIf you happen to go to the\r\ndungeon, could you check on him?",
        "Jp" : "城外の奪還をするなら\r\n欠かせない存在のはずなんですが――\r\n地下牢へ行くことがあれば\r\n様子を見てきてもらえませんか？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 633782,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : -1
    } ],
    "NameDispOff" : false,
