      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Who's there? Friend or foe?\r\nDoesn't matter - stay calm! \r\nJust... hear me out first.",
        "Jp" : "だれ！？　敵？　味方？\r\nいや、どっちでもいい、慌てないで――\r\nまずボクの話を聞いてほしい"
