      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 9,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Wait... who are you? \r\nYou don't look like an orc—\r\ndid you come to rescue me!?",
        "Jp" : "いや――、キミは――だれ？\r\n見たところオークではないようだけど――\r\nひょっとしてボクを助けに来てくれたのかい！？"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 633784,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 2
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 10,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Lookout Castle was under attack by the Demon Army,\r\nand our soldiers kept holding out within the walls.\r\nBut suddenly, an Evil Eye appeared, and then...",
        "Jp" : "展望城が魔軍の襲撃を受けて\r\n兵たちと城内で抵抗を続けていたんだけど\r\n突如、邪悪な目が現れ、そこからはもう――"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 634725,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 3
    }, {
      "@class" : "org.sehkah.ddon.tools.extractor.common.logic.resource.entity.ui.MsgData",
      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 11,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Anyway! Can you get me out of here!?\r\nI'll make it worth your while!",
        "Jp" : "とにかく！\r\nここからボクを連れ出してくれないか！？\r\nちゃんとお礼はするとも！"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 634726,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
      "TalkFaceType" : 0,
      "VoiceReqNo" : 4
