      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Strange. Most people leave with a sigh as\r\nsoon as I start repeating myself.",
        "Jp" : "おかしいな、だいたいの奴は\r\n２回目が始まった途端\r\n溜息交じりにこの場を去るのだが"
